---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/cases/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Converge/check module infrastructure across adopted projects; repair with the same command

Usage: instrukt install [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --check            Compare desired and actual infrastructure without changing packages,
                         services or data
      --module <MODULE>  Limit convergence to an enabled module's dependencies. Full demand still
                         protects shared resources [possible values: todos, events, history,
                         blueprint, conversations]
      --json             Render per-resource results and findings as JSON
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version

Scheduler locations: SYSTEMD_UNIT_PATH selects the native systemd search path (the running manager
must include the first explicit absolute directory). INSTRUKT_LAUNCH_AGENTS_DIR selects an absolute
plist directory, default ~/Library/LaunchAgents; alternate directories are loaded explicitly and are
not login-scanned automatically. INSTRUKT_CRONTAB_FILE selects an absolute file-only table, never
account registration; unset uses the executing user's native crontab.
